Casa Delta dashboard for OPNsense. Shows the live up/down status and latency of
a configurable list of hosts, grouped and ordered, on a dedicated status page.
Hosts are managed in the GUI and stored in the firewall configuration. Viewing
status and managing hosts use separate privileges.

Requires OPNsense 26.7 or later

Plugin Changelog
================

0.1.0

* Host status page with ICMP checks that run only while the page is viewed
* Host settings page (add, edit, enable/disable, delete monitored hosts)
* Separate privileges for viewing status and managing settings
* Requires OPNsense 26.7 or later
